","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064605009:1":{"text":"我试图追问，但他对镜子的来历三缄其口，这让我愈发担心。荣耀和正义不会隐藏自己，邪恶才会。","source_cn":"我试图追问，但他对镜子的来历三缄其口，这让我愈发担心。...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3455E70B0ED4E3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"107059","variant_female_record_index":"107060","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064605010:1":{"text":"艾雅在上，我去圣堂祷告时，无数次路过因叛乱损毁的街道。烟灰和血迹被清洗得很干净，但我知道它们曾在那里。","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我去圣堂祷告时，无数次路过因叛乱损毁的街道。...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x2699CF292F44CFED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"107061","variant_female_record_index":"107062","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064605011:1":{"text":"所以我做出决定，朗贝尔家族必须要与过往的一切划清界限，由我开始。","source_cn":"所以我做出决定，朗贝尔家族必须要与过往的一切划清界限，...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xB69955CF8FBC96B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"107063","variant_female_record_index":"107064","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064605012:1":{"text":"父亲死后，我开始尝试毁掉那面镜子，好在只要用布盖着，它就很安静。","source_cn":"父亲死后，我开始尝试毁掉那面镜子，好在只要用布盖着，它...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1157BEB71172493C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"107065","variant_female_record_index":"107066","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064605013:1":{"text":"但每次击碎，它的残骸都会留在原地，然后裂隙敞开……新的东西重新从裂隙中爬出来。","source_cn":"但每次击碎，它的残骸都会留在原地，然后裂隙敞开……新的...","status":"target_te